      "Level layout. Segments play in order; 'bars' is each one's length, so pacing is tuned by changing bars here",
      "(keep the total at the excerpt's bar count) and re-running: python tools/chart.py skyhigh",
      "mode: tap | hold | colour | dodge | spinner | dual.  lap = beats per trip round the ring (the tool speeds it up where notes are dense; lapFixed keeps it).",
      "look: palette name plus optional [from, to] ramps across the segment: zoom, rot (camera turns), drain (colour loss), vignette, ring (ring size).",
      "plan: per difficulty (N/H/I), one pattern per bar, repeated across the segment. Vocabulary is documented at the top of tools/chart.py:",
      "C= cyan voice, P= pink voice, W= white voice, each one of: beat 8 16 all half tail off hold - or @<16 steps> for an explicit shape;",
      "flags: stack (both hands accent beat 1), acc, solo (one hand at a time); options: run=<max burst> minRun=<shortest hold run>.",
      "motif / cycle: segments sharing a motif name are one repeating musical figure of `cycle` bars. cyan / pink / white: which measured layer the voice follows."
